review_comments.body:
```suggestion
    // NOTE: We cannot call Py_CLEAR(self->parent) prior to calling
    //       XML_ParserFree(self->itself) in xmlparse_dealloc() since
    //       otherwise a subparser could lose its parent XML_Parser
    //       while still making use of it internally.
    //       See https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/139400.
```

Since XML_ExternalEntityParserCreate is a long word, we can drop it here. I think it'll be clear enough (and that way, I don't need to update this comment if we were to ever have a way to create subparsers differently in the future).
